Largest packaged files are processed/raw CVM CSVs and the SQLite DB. The largest observed CSV was `dist/CVMAnalytics/data/input/processed/itr_cia_aberta_DMPL_con_2020.csv` at about 127.92 MB.

### Database Snapshot

